<title>USA: American Stock Exchange to list 13 flex options.</title>
<headline>American Stock Exchange to list 13 flex options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said on Friday it will list equity flexible options, or E-FLEX options, on 13 stocks beginning October 24.</p>
<p>The 13 companies are: America Online Inc, Apple Computer Inc, Digital Equipment Corp., Disney (Walt) Company (The), du Pont (E.I) de Nemours &amp; Co, Grupo Televisa, S.A., Intel Corp, Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc, Motorola Inc, Philip Morris Co Inc., Telebras, Tele-Communications, and Telefonos de Mexico, SA de CV.</p>
</text>
